# SCENARIO: goto_unreachable_demo   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: none   BOTCFG: off
# Contract check: a goto onto a wall must come back STUCK (exit 3) with pos= = where the
# character actually stopped. 32363,32240,7 is the Thais temple west wall (dump-view '#',
# walkable floor on both sides). Cross-check: result.md "Final DB position" (saved on logout)
# must equal the STUCK pos.
@p1 login
@p1 goto 32367,32240,7 range=1 stuck=10
@p1 dump-view
@p1 goto 32363,32240,7 stuck=8
@p1 logout
